      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow3:021",
        "answer": "Constructs CoD.WZObituary from the displayed menu/controller/layout arguments. Creates background as LUI.UIImage.new, ObituaryEntry0 as CoD.WZObituaryEntry.new, ObituaryEntry1 as CoD.WZObituaryEntry.new, ObituaryEntry2 as CoD.WZObituaryEntry.new, ObituaryEntry3 as CoD.WZObituaryEntry.new, ObituaryEntry4 as CoD.WZObituaryEntry.new, ObituaryEntry5 as CoD.WZObituaryEntry.new, ObituaryEntry6 as CoD.WZObituaryEntry.new. Connects 7 model/path references; the model subscription effects below specify which receiver changes and under which nil/value guard. Installs 1 event/action/override bindings; each callback keeps its captured controller/menu/widget references and executes only on its bound delivery. The ordered effect contract retains every property, model, visual, navigation, callback and return mutation in source order; returning self is not proof the original game loads this widget.",
